                <text x="295" y="115" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8ba3b8" font-size="11">Signal når strålen er BRYDT</text>
            </svg>`,

            wiring: `
            <svg viewBox="0 0 400 160" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <!-- Sensor body -->
                <rect x="30" y="40" width="70" height="50" rx="6" fill="#5a6a7a"/>
                <circle cx="65" cy="65" r="12" fill="#00a3e0"/>
                <!-- Wires -->
                <line x1="100" y1="50" x2="180" y2="40" stroke="#a0522d" stroke-width="4"/>
